Shame that you lost the wish, here's my own wish strategy:

What to wish for:
1. Blessed +2 gray dragon scale mail.  (Dragon scale is the best armor,
and this way I get the best intrinsic.)
2. Blessed +2 silver dragon scale mail.  (For reflection, if I don't
already have gray, and if I already have magic resistance.  Note that
black scale mail is less useful than this, since there are only two
ways to be disintegrated, the first is covered by reflection, and the
second never happens if you're careful where you pray.)
3. Blessed fireproof +2 boots of speed.  (For permanent intrinsic
speed.  Speed is not necessary, but it is a very useful intrinsic.)
4. Blessed bag of holding (if one is not averse to Sokoban it's best to
check there first)
5. Blessed wand of death (Always good to have spares.)
6. Blessed spellbook of Magic Mapping (For mazes, although this depends
on whether my character has a decent success rate at it.)
7. Blessed spellbook of Identify (Again depends on success rate, and
whether the good stuff gets ID'd early.)
8. Blessed magic marker.  (One marker is usually worth more than any
single scroll, if the scroll in question is known.)
9. Wand of cancellation.  (These are sometimes rare.  For emergencies,
blanking scrolls and spellbooks, turning potions to water,
10. Blessed scroll of genocide.  (If one hasn't been found, a magic
marker is generally more useful.  Favorite targets: L ; h R.  Of
course, not h if I'm a dwarf.)
11. Ring of conflict (depending on how confident I am)
12. Cloak of displacement (Middling cancellation, and only if magic
resistance is GDSM-derived, but this can be a fun item.)

Important things I don't wish for if I can help it:
Lizard corpse.  (Usually can be found.)
Unicorn horn.  (Usually found.)
Scrolls of enchant armor or weapon.  (Are common enough that you can
usually happen upon them, and once they're known they're easy enough to
make with a magic marker.)
Scrolls of identify (Are usually common enough.  Once in a while the
game is stingy with them, though.)

This is probably an incomplete list, just trying to throw out some
ideas.

